  "title": "Enpro Increases Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "Enpro Inc. (NYSE: NPO) today declared a quarterly dividend of $0.32 per share, a 3.2% increase from the previous $0.31 per share quarterly dividend. Since initiating a dividend in 2015, the company has increased its quarterly payout annually. “We are pleased to increase our dividend again for the eleventh consecutive year. The increase reflects the strength of our balance sheet, consistent cash generation and positive long-term outlook. We remain committed to balanced capital allocation while dr",
